a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s002280100322\">10.1007/s002280100322</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11699611\">11699611</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Kerbusch_2001_4: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
